WEBVTT

00:03:56.232 --> 00:04:00.945
results from a complex legacy
of housing segregation,

00:04:00.945 --> 00:04:03.364
land use and zoning discrimination,

00:04:03.406 --> 00:04:07.326
and from unequal enforcement and policies.

00:04:07.368 --> 00:04:09.829
Now decades ago,

00:04:09.870 --> 00:04:11.831
policies such as redlining

00:04:11.831 --> 00:04:16.210
denied home loans to people of color
into certain communities.

00:04:16.502 --> 00:04:21.340
And this government policy
reinforced racial segregation in cities

00:04:21.382 --> 00:04:25.219
and diverted investments
away from those communities,

00:04:25.261 --> 00:04:28.723
creating large disparities
in home ownership

00:04:28.764 --> 00:04:31.851
as well as urban heat environments.